1
00:00:00,952 --> 00:00:05,912
(Penny:)Okay, just for the record,
I have never entered a wet T-shirt contest.

2
00:00:06,124 --> 00:00:09,424
(Penny:)I've won a few, but that's just
because I spill when I'm drunk.

3
00:00:11,296 --> 00:00:15,786
(Amy:)We could go to the cadaver lab at UCLA
and play real-life Operation.

4
00:00:17,535 --> 00:00:18,555
(Sheldon:)- No.
- Uh-uh.

5
00:00:18,737 --> 00:00:19,757
(Penny:)I don't think so.

6
00:00:19,971 --> 00:00:21,771
(Amy:)You sure?
The nose doesn't light up...

7
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:25,570
(Amy:)...but if the corpse is fresh enough
sometimes you can get the leg to jerk.

8
00:00:29,114 --> 00:00:33,644
(Howard:)Hey, Ma, twinkle, twinkle,
your little star is home!

9
00:00:34,853 --> 00:00:37,683
Ma, the chain's on the door!

10
00:00:37,856 --> 00:00:42,516
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Howard? I thought
I wasn't going to see you till tomorrow!

11
00:00:42,694 --> 00:00:46,634
(Howard:)Yeah, well, Bernie's not feeling well,
so I thought I'd stop by.

12
00:00:46,798 --> 00:00:49,358
(Howard:)Tell you about
the greatest adventure of my life.

13
00:00:49,567 --> 00:00:52,097
(Howard:)See if you can make me feel bad about it.

14
00:00:53,972 --> 00:00:57,462
Okay! Hold on, I'm not decent!

15
00:00:57,642 --> 00:00:59,302
(Leonard:)All right.

